{comment: Intro}
| [E] [A] | [B] | ×4

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[E]Passover [A]in Jerusa[B]lem
Money changers at their ta[E]bles
Cattle, [A]sheep and doves for [B]sale
In the courts of the tem[E]ple
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Instrumental}
| [A] | [B] | [B] | [E] |
