Not a market[E]place
My Father's [B]house, my Father's [A]house
Not a market[E]place [A][B][E][A][B]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[E]His dis[A]ciples remem[B]bered
What was written long a[E]go
Zeal for your [A]house will consume [B]me
Zeal for your house will consume [E]me
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
